      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure this belongs as part of the `ec_library()` definition.  I think I prefer the library to manage it\u0027s own sources directly using `target_sources` in it\u0027s own CMakeLists.txt file.  This should should scale better for libraries with many sources, subdirectories, multiple Kconfig options, etc.",
