      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T17:06:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The thinking was that a library would be self contained (in the hopes) that this would make browsing our code more manageable. I\u0027ll likely add `ec_library_ifdef()` at some point, but I\u0027m thinking that a library won\u0027t conditionally include sources (ideally), instead if we have some features that are some times implemented, they should be a separate library. This model very well could break down. I think I want to start overly restrictive and loosen up if needed, than start off with a fully free form and have to clean things up later.",
      "parentUuid": "b365a234_b77d0173",
      "range": {
