      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T17:30:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shell commands are the first example I can think of that are controlled by a Kconfig but don\u0027t belong in a separate library.\n\nIs `ec_library()` additive? i.e is this allowed:\n```\nec_library(spi_flash_reg \n  HEADER public/spi_flash_reg.h\n  PUBLIC_INCLUDES public)\n  \nec_library(spi_flash_reg\n  SOURCES src/spi_flash_reg.c)\nec_library_ifdef(CONFIG_SHELL spi_flash_reg\n  SOURCES src/spi_flash_reg_shell.c)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "e3e71479_87ffe12b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 16,
