      "writtenOn": "2022-11-08T08:52:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can probably make it that way, right now you would need to do:\n```\nec_library(spi_flash_reg\n  HEADERS\n    public/spi_flash_reg.h\n  PUBLIC_INCLUDES\n    public\n)\ntarget_add_sources(spi_flash_reg PRIVATE src/spi_flash_reg.c)\ntarget_add_sources_ifdef(CONFIG_SHELL spi_flash_reg\n    PRIVATE src/spi_flash_reg_shell.c)\n```\n\nBut what I had in mind was something like:\n```\nec_library(spi_flash_reg ...)\nec_library_ifdef(spi_flash_reg_shell\n  SOURCES\n    src/spi_flash_reg_shell.c\n  PRIVATE_DEPS\n    spi_flash_reg\n)\n```\n\nThis forces the spi_flash_reg library to be functional without the shell command, but the shell command to require the spi_flash_reg library.",
      "parentUuid": "05a8244e_66e67509",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 23
      },
